#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  BugBountyOne — Single-file all-in-one bug bounty scanner
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Usage:
    python bugbounty_one.py https://target.com

That's it. The script will:
  1. Auto-check residential proxy file
     - If missing/empty → auto-harvest from validated sources (residential only)
     - If stale (>24h) → refresh (re-test all, drop dead)
     - If running low → harvest more
  2. Use existing + new proxies
  3. Run the full deep scan (subdomain enum + 20+ vuln modules)
  4. Save beautiful MD report + JSON to /home/z/my-project/download/

Optional flags:
    --proxy <URL>           Use a single static proxy
    --proxy-file <PATH>    Custom proxy file (overrides default)
    --no-auto-proxy        Don't auto-load residential proxies
    --threads N            Concurrent workers (default 15)
    --timeout N            Per-request timeout (default 12)
    --no-deep              Skip deep testing (faster)
    --subdomains           Enumerate subdomains
    --oob-callback-host H  OOB host for SSRF testing
    --resume PATH          Resume from state file
    --install-deps         Auto-install missing deps
    --harvest-only         Only pull proxies, don't scan
    --scan-only            Only scan, don't refresh proxies
    --full-auto            ONE COMMAND: proxies + scan + reports + cloud upload
    --no-proxy             FORCE DIRECT — skip ALL proxy logic, attack any
                            target directly with ALL 70+ tools (fastest mode)
    --no-proxy-required    Alias for --no-proxy (force direct attacks)
    --direct-only          Skip proxy harvest even if direct is blocked
    -h, --help             Show help

DIRECT ATTACK MODE:
    When direct connection works OR --no-proxy is used:
      ✓ Skip ALL proxy harvesting (saves time)
      ✓ Skip proxy quality testing (saves time)
      ✓ Run all 70+ external tools DIRECTLY
      ✓ Maximum speed (no proxy overhead)
      ✓ Attack any target without needing proxies

    Example: python bugbounty_one.py https://target.com --full-auto --no-proxy
             python bugbounty_one.py https://target.com --full-auto --no-proxy-required

Custom sources:
    Set env var BUGBOUNTY_PROXY_SOURCES_FILE=/path/to/sources.txt
    Format: one URL per line (HTTP/SOCKS4/SOCKS5 inferred from content)
    Or:
    export BUGBOUNTY_EXTRA_HTTP_SOURCES="url1,url2,url3"
    export BUGBOUNTY_EXTRA_SOCKS5_SOURCES="url1,url2"

Author: Nyx for He 😍
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
"""

